    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Study 2 — Sudan Restaurant Industry (Diab et al.,
      2016).</strong> Marketing and Branding Research, 3, 153-165. n=387
      across 4 full-service restaurants in Khartoum, Sudan. <a href="https://www.academia.edu/38178534">Full text</a>.
    </p>
